### 1. Generate July 2026 payroll for Anita (id=4), basic salary 50000
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payroll/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 4,
  "month": 7,
  "year": 2026,
  "basicSalary": 50000
}

### 2. Try generating the SAME month again - should return 409 (already generated)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payroll/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 4,
  "month": 7,
  "year": 2026,
  "basicSalary": 50000
}

### 3. See Anita's payroll history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payroll?employeeId=4